<title>LEBANON: SOCCER-LEBANON BEAT GEORGIA 3-2 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEBANON BEAT GEORGIA 3-2 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon beat Georgia 3-2 (halftime</p>
<p>3-2) in a friendly soccer match on Sunday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Lebanon - Hassan Ayyoub 15 penalty, Jamal Taha 23, Wartan</p>
<p>Ghazarian 27.</p>
<p>Georgia - Gakhokidze Georgi 13, Tskitishvili</p>
<p>Levan 24.</p>
</text>
